# arvo-mask-contracts

The `MaskOps` const trait (renamed from `Mask`;
the prior `const W: Width` parameter dropped).
Abstract surface for the `Mask<W>` chassis and `BitMatrix<W, N>`
concretes from `arvo-bitmask`. Consumers that depend only on the
abstract mask surface pull this crate, not the concrete-storage one.
`#![no_std]`, no alloc.
